Subject: [PATCH DRAFT] drm/msm/dsi: Record the first raw error tuple

Diagnostic candidate based on5902d3af6f6254604d88f9d5590b66ad73de5dbf.
Reuse six existing status reads and the already-read ISR. Preserve all
W1C writes, masks, resets and work scheduling. Print once per host per
IRQ-enable cycle without relying on a shared printk ratelimit.
No new hardware reads, controller changes, or default configuration.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
